coolscan3: Initial working support for the Nikon Super Coolscan LS-5000 ED (16-bit RGB and RGBI/infrared scanning; firmware 1.03 previously rejected commands carrying an uninitialized parameter block). RGB multi-sampling and autofocus were verified separately. Frame selection was verified on a modified SA-21 operating as SA-30; this does not establish support for stock SA-21 or other feeders. Combined RGBI multi-sampling is intentionally rejected, and the tested 8-bit path is rejected by firmware 1.03.
